        sisterModels: [ { name: "BMW 520d (F10 Sedan)", note: "The standard F10 sedan utilizes the exact same N47D20 engine. It suffers from the exact same timing chain snapping issues, but because the sedan is significantly lighter, the engine is under slightly less constant stress." } ],
